1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,060
The teacher who treated Harry Potter like dirt

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:04,660
spent the boy's whole life keeping him alive.

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:05,540
Severus Snape grew up

4
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,770
in a house full of shouting.

5
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:07,720
Then he saw a girl

6
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,600
make a flower open in her hand.

7
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,380
Lily Evans.

8
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,880
He told her she was a witch.

9
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,000
For a boy nobody noticed,

10
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,140
she was proof he mattered.

11
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,020
At Hogwarts, she went to Gryffindor.

12
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,020
He went to Slytherin,

13
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:19,280
where the Dark Arts made him feel powerful.

14
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,280
Then James Potter's gang humiliated him

15
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:22,310
in front of everyone.

16
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:23,560
Lily stood up for him.

17
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:25,100
And to prove he didn't need her,

18
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,280
he called her the one word

19
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,630
he could never take back.

20
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:28,840
She walked away.

21
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:29,980
He chose Voldemort.

22
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,720
He carried a prophecy to his master,

23
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,620
then realized who it pointed to.

24
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:34,330
Lily's son.

25
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,480
He begged Voldemort to spare her.

26
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,280
He begged Dumbledore to hide her.

27
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,250
It wasn't enough.

28
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,040
So he made a promise.

29
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,540
Protect the boy with her eyes.

30
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,580
But the boy had her eyes,

31
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,240
in James Potter's face.

32
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:47,040
So he guarded Harry and punished him,

33
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,340
and crushed kids like Neville

34
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:49,620
who couldn't fight back.

35
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:50,580
That explains it.

36
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:51,830
It doesn't excuse it.

37
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:52,900
When Dumbledore asked

38
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:53,980
if he cared for the boy,

39
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:56,280
Snape conjured her silver doe.

40
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,310
After all this time?

41
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:58,570
Always.

42
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:01,560
Dying, he asked Harry for one last thing.

43
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,430
Look at me.

44
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:03,960
Maybe so the last thing

45
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,740
he ever saw was her eyes.
